<title>POLAND: BEST TURNS TO PLN 0.3 MLN LOSS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>BEST TURNS TO PLN 0.3 MLN LOSS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.31 vs   0.40 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.49 vs   0.58 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.15 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Sales		    3.23 vs   3.51</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.50 vs   1.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.44 vs   2.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.36 vs   2.93</p>
<p> Sales		   20.43 vs  20.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Best</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Handlowe SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
